ounts[index], 0, counts[index + 1], 0, 3);\n                index++;\n                switch (ch) {\n                    case 'V': counts[index][0]++; vCount++; locations[0].add(index); break;\n                    case 'K': counts[index][1]++; kCount++; locations[1].add(index); break;\n                    default:  counts[index][2]++; sCount++; locations[2].add(index); break;\n                }\n            }\n            memoTable = new int[vCount + 1][kCount + 1][sCount + 1][3];\n            for (int[][][] slice : memoTable) for (int[][] grid : slice) for (int[] line : grid) Arrays.fill(line, -1);\n            out.println(compute(0, 0, 0, 2));\n        }\n\n        int compute(int tv, int tk, int ts, int last) {\n            if (tv == vCount && tk == kCount && ts == sCount) return 0;\n            if (memoTable[tv][tk][ts][last] != -1) return memoTable[tv][tk][ts][last];\n            int optimal = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n            if (tv < vCount) {\n                int p = locations[0].get(tv);\n                int cost = Math.max(counts[p][0] - tv, 0) + Math.max(counts[p][1] - tk, 0) + Math.max(counts[p][2] - ts, 0) - 1;\n                optimal = Math.min(optimal, compute(tv + 1, tk, ts, 0) + cost);\n            }\n            if (tk < kCount && last != 0) {\n                int p = locations[1].get(tk);\n                int cost = Math.max(counts[p][0] - tv, 0) + Math.max(counts[p][1] - tk, 0) + Math.max(counts[p][2] - ts, 0) - 1;\n                optimal = Math.min(optimal, compute(tv, tk + 1, ts, 1) + cost);\n            }\n            if (ts < sCount) {\n                int p = locations[2].get(ts);\n                int cost = Math.max(counts[p][0] - tv, 0) + Math.max(counts[p][1] - tk, 0) + Math.max(counts[p][2] - ts, 0) - 1;\n                optimal = Math.min(optimal, compute(tv, tk, ts + 1, 2) + cost);\n            }\n            return memoTable[tv][tk][ts][last] = optimal;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class InputReader {\n        private final InputSt